#ASSERT `Can this property be designated as notional estate for me` `it went through a transaction they entered into` `gift` FALSE TRUE FALSE (`d` 27 2 2021) (`d` 29 2 2024) TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE `not enough` (`d` 1 9 2024) FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
